**Vulnerability Scanning Program:**
- **Microsoft Defender Vulnerability Management:** Continuous agent-based vulnerability scanning of managed endpoints
- **Microsoft Secure Score:** Configuration vulnerability assessment for M365 services
- **Intune Compliance:** Device compliance scans detect configuration drift from security baselines
- **Scan Frequency:** Continuous (agent-based), daily (configuration), weekly (comprehensive)

